 - 2026-06-15: PHASE A3 (HEADLINE; the real OOD test) -- CROSS-GAME transfer of the ARC oracle-distinct verifier. The .393 win used HELD-OUT TASKS within the SAME games; the real generalization test is HELD-OUT GAMES. Carnot's own prior evidence warns this is where learned ARC signals collapse (ARC-1->ARC-2 transfer: induction 0.93->0.57, project_gap3_verifier_program). Split the grown pool BY GAME: train the set-encoder on a subset of games, test the beats-vote gate on candidates from games NEVER seen in training. Report cross_game_delta (set_encoder@1 - vote@1 on held-out GAMES) + CI95 + the held-out-game count + the within-game-vs-cross-game gap. A surviving cross-game win = a GENERAL selection signal (huge for the north star). A collapse = the verifier memorizes per-game basins (decision-grade; SCOPES the headline to within-game and refocuses .395 on cross-game generalization). verifier_is_oracle=false. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_arc_game_ids_unrecoverable; results/experiment_4258_arc_oracle_distinct_cross_game_transfer.json
 - 2026-06-15: PHASE A4 (EXTEND the win; gated_on A1 win_survives_provenance_blind AND A2 oracle_distinct_win_replicates) -- selection->SYNTHESIS: break the oracle@K ceiling. The .393 win is SELECTION (pick the best cached candidate), capped at oracle@K=0.827 -- 17% of held-out tasks have NO correct candidate, so selection can NEVER solve them. Compute-as-Teacher (2509.14234) + Generative-Aggregation (2503.04104): SYNTHESIS can construct an answer that EXCEEDS the best rollout. Build an AggLM-style review-reconcile-SYNTHESIZE step: DeepSets-weighted per-CELL reconciliation over the top-ranked candidate family (weight each candidate's per-cell vote by the learned set-encoder score) -> a synthesized grid that MAY differ from every candidate; validate by EXACT ARC grid match. Report synthesis@1 vs vote@1 vs selector-only@1 (the .393 set-encoder) vs a no-synthesis baseline vs oracle@K, task-level bootstrap CI95. Headline target: synthesis@1 > oracle@K on the held-out split (recovering tasks where NO candidate was correct). verifier_is_oracle=false. Fabrication guard: EXACT grid-match gate + the explicit no-synthesis control (per the .393 SOTA-ingestion warning). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: arc_synthesis_underperforms_selection; results/experiment_4259_arc_agglm_grid_synthesis.json
 - 2026-06-15: PHASE B1 (STAGE the scale-up; gated_on A1 win_survives_provenance_blind AND A2 oracle_distinct_win_replicates) -- DiffusionGemma energy-guided-diffusion PREFLIGHT (NOT the full run). The oracle-distinct gate is now resolvable (exp4245) AND DiffusionGemma is CACHED (google/diffusiongemma-26B-A4B-it + unsloth/diffusiongemma-26B-A4B-it-GGUF). The gated forward-queue entry (docs/research-notes/diffusiongemma-energy-guided-diffusion-spec.md) becomes activatable -- but ONLY after the .394 win is hardened, and ONLY as a PREFLIGHT this milestone (the operator was twice-burned by premature scale-up over-claims). PREFLIGHT: load DiffusionGemma-GGUF (vocab_only or a tiny smoke), wire the verifier ensemble as a GUIDANCE energy that reweights per-step token selection on a TINY denoising smoke (few steps, <=5 examples), confirm the guidance hook actually changes token selection vs unguided, and emit a GO/NO-GO + a cost estimate for the full .395 run. Methods: discrete-diffusion guidance (2406.01572), GTL (2512.10877), EDLM (2506.13759). NO full benchmark; NO training; the full run is DEFERRED to .395. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_diffusiongemma_gguf_loader_failed; results/experiment_4260_diffusiongemma_energy_guided_preflight.json
